%% @title Refunds under €50 are approved automatically; bigger ones still go to a person
%% @subtitle Proposed refund flow. Pick a branch at each decision, or play a named path.
%% @caption Only the amount check is new; the email to an agent goes away.
%% @path Small refund, approved automatically: ask > ok > small > issued > done
flowchart TD
  ask([Customer asks for a refund]) --> ok{Order refundable?}
  ok -->|no| refused[Refused, reason shown]
  ok -->|yes| small{Amount under €50?}
  small -->|yes| issued[Refund issued]
  small -->|no| agent[Agent reviews it]
  agent -->|approves| email[Email the agent for approval]
  email --> issued
  agent -->|rejects| refused
  issued --> done([Done])
  refused --> done

  %% @ask detail: From the order page. The shop sends the order id and a reason.
  %% @ask raw: POST /refunds
